# F122 ARM A -- the travel ALONE, from a SETTLED point anchor.
# internal/fly_to_selected.sts's own preamble and its own two camera lines,
# with ONE line added: a `wait duration 2` between the point transition and
# the travel, so the two land in DIFFERENT frames. A is the control for B:
# the two files differ by that one line and by nothing else.
body action preload name selected
timerate rate 1
flag track_object on
audio filename lift-off.wav action play
wait duration 1
moveto altitude 20000000 duration 3
wait duration 3
camera action transition_to target point name Space
wait duration 2
camera action move_to target body body_name selected duration 3 altitude 100000
